1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 24=

17
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,630
He has multiple fractures.

18
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,190
If a broken rib had punctured an organ,
it would've been serious.

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,950
Thankfully, his life isn't in danger.

20
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,230
It could've been much worse.

21
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,510
When will he wake up?

22
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,470
It's hard to say.

23
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,190
The scans show no major head injury.

24
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,030
Just a mild concussion.

25
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,590
The bigger concern is

26
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,070
his left metacarpal is fractured.

27
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,150
He'll need surgery to set it.

28
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:54,830
He'll need plenty of rest afterward.

29
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,310
It depends on how his body heals.

30
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,590
For now, he needs to stay in bed.

31
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:02,830
Actually,

32
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,710
given how bad the crash was,

33
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,790
your side should've taken

34
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,870
the brunt of the impact.

35
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:14,430
Ms. Su.

36
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,110
Mr. Ji found the person behind this.

37
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:27,430
This is kidnapping!

38
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,030
Careful, Ms. Ge.

39
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,790
We only invited you here as our guest.

40
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,630
Mr. Ji.

41
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,710
Su Yan.

42
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,590
Why do you always have men backing you?

43
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,510
How do you always manage to bounce back?

44
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,790
You sent my dad to prison.

45
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,630
You destroyed my life.

46
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,350
As long as I'm alive,

47
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,550
I'll make you pay.

48
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,830
You spread lies about me back then,

49
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,670
and I still didn't hate you.

50
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,470
But you hurt the person
I care about most.

51
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,110
I won't let you get away with this.

52
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,350
We have all the evidence
that you tampered

53
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,190
with the brakes.

54
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,550
You should be grateful

55
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,430
no one died because of you.

56
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,510
Otherwise, you'd face far worse than

57
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,270
a beating and prison time.

58
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:11,630
Mr. Ji.

59
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:13,390
I wasn't after you.

60
00:02:13,390 --> 00:02:14,390
I was only after her.

61
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:14,630
I...

62
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,910
We'll leave the rest to the police.

63
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,350
Ms. Su.

64
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,190
Mr. Ji! Mr. Ji!

65
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,710
Mr. Ji! Mr. Ji!

66
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,910
Thanks, Mr. Ji.

67
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:33,710
Su Yan.

68
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,470
I have one more favor to ask.

69
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,470
Go ahead, Mr. Ji.

70
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:42,790
I know

71
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,230
you and Cheng Lin are close.

72
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,270
And you were in the crash together.

73
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,390
Word will get out soon.

74
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,230
I'm sure

75
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,190
you understand.

76
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:58,950
In families like ours,

77
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,030
we don't get to choose who we marry.

78
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,190
So,

79
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,110
you and Cheng Lin...

80
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,950
I understand.

81
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,950
I'll give it some serious thought.

82
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,110
Thank you.

83
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,310
(I know you and Cheng Lin are close.)

84
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,270
(And you were in the crash together.)

85
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,630
(Word will get out soon.)

86
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:33,670
(Actually,)

87
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,950
(your side should've taken the brunt.)

88
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,910
(Yet you and Tangtang are both fine.)

89
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,750
(At the last second,)

90
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,190
(Cheng Lin must've shielded you both.)

91
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:40,850
♪You turn back when the lights go out♪

92
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:47,770
♪Back toward the shelter you once knew♪

93
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,790
♪But it's already gone♪

94
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:52,580
♪By the time you turn around♪

95
00:04:52,580 --> 00:04:53,500
♪He's already♪

96
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:55,890
♪Vanished into the crowd♪

97
00:04:55,890 --> 00:04:57,430
♪Now you're left♪

98
00:04:57,430 --> 00:05:00,300
♪With nothing but regret♪

99
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,110
Why hasn't he woken up yet?

100
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:03,910
What if he...

101
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,830
Don't think like that.

102
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:06,230
He'll wake up.

103
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,430
♪Why didn't you give him an answer?♪

104
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,180
(Su Yan.)

105
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,380
(Tell me.)

106
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:15,800
(What would make you feel better?)

107
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:19,260
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

108
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:22,780
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

109
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:26,300
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

110
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:30,060
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

111
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:48,540
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

112
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:52,180
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

113
00:05:52,180 --> 00:05:55,380
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

114
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:59,060
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

115
00:05:59,060 --> 00:06:02,460
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

116
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:06,140
♪I hum this song alone♪

117
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:09,980
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

118
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:14,060
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

119
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:17,340
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

120
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:20,940
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

121
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:24,420
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

122
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:29,300
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
